<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-SCOTLAND RECALL PATTERSON.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SCOTLAND RECALL PATTERSON.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland's 21-man-squad to face Italy at Murrayfield on Saturday week shows three changes from last month's defeat by Australia.</p>
<p>Injured scrum-half Gary Armstrong is replaced by Derrick Patterson, capped only once against South Africa two years ago, with forwards Andy Reed and Mattie Stewart also drafted in.</p>
